sequenceDiagram
  actor Cashier
  participant UI as React POS
  participant API as NestJS Sales Controller
  participant Svc as Sales Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Cashier->>UI: Submit cart and payment
  UI->>API: POST /sales
  API->>API: Authenticate and authorize
  API->>Svc: createSale(command)
  Svc->>DB: BEGIN transaction
  Svc->>DB: Validate price, branch and stock
  alt Serialized unit
    Svc->>DB: Conditional update unit IN_STOCK -> SOLD
  else Quantity stock
    Svc->>DB: Conditional decrement where available >= qty
  end
  Svc->>DB: Insert sale, items, payment, movements, audit
  Svc->>DB: COMMIT
  DB-->>Svc: Persisted sale
  Svc-->>API: Receipt DTO
  API-->>UI: 201 Created + receipt
  UI-->>Cashier: Display/print receipt
  Note over UI,DB: Module 6 detail: idempotency key (replay → 200 original sale); products locked FOR SHARE; valuations then balances then units in sorted order; quantity: conditional decrement on_hand − reserved ≥ q; serialized: IN_STOCK → SOLD conditional; SALE ledger rows; Σ payments = total (deferred trigger); VAT snapshot; audit sale.completed
